+msgctxt "#62741"
+msgid "Picture mode for the menus"
+msgstr ""
+
+#: xbmc/network/ProjectorControl.cpp
+#. Hades: the projector control: help of videoscreen.hadesprojectormodemenus; translated in Estuary (#54742)
+msgctxt "#62742"
+msgid "The picture mode for the menus, while no video plays (a video paused with its controls shown still plays). For example a user mode in Rec.709 or DCI for the menus, and another in BT.2020 for videos. It is sent once the projector has locked onto the signal of the menus, a few seconds after a video ends: the next video of a playlist, which starts before that, does not change the mode. As for SDR video: the menus take the mode for SDR video, and nothing is sent when an SDR video ends (the default). Leave it as it is: Hades does not touch it."
+msgstr ""
+
+#: xbmc/network/ProjectorControl.cpp
+#. Hades: the projector control: label of videoscreen.hadesprojectormodesdr2020; translated in Estuary (#54743)
+msgctxt "#62743"
+msgid "Picture mode for SDR in BT.2020"
+msgstr ""
+
+#: xbmc/network/ProjectorControl.cpp
+#. Hades: the projector control: help of videoscreen.hadesprojectormodesdr2020; translated in Estuary (#54744)
+msgctxt "#62744"
+msgid "The picture mode for a video that goes out as SDR in BT.2020: HDR that Hades maps to SDR in BT.2020 (\"HDR to SDR: gamut of the output\" at BT.2020), and an SDR video of BT.2020 sent as it is (\"Keep the wide colours of SDR videos (BT.2020)\"). For example a user mode with the BT.2020 colour profile. As for SDR video: the mode for SDR video (the default). Leave it as it is: Hades does not touch it. A model refuses a mode it does not have, and kodi.log says so."
+msgstr ""
+
+#: xbmc/network/ProjectorControl.cpp
+#. Hades: the projector control: value of the picture modes of the menus and of SDR in a wide gamut: the mode for SDR video; translated in Estuary (#54745)
+msgctxt "#62745"
+msgid "As for SDR video"
+msgstr ""
+
+#: xbmc/network/ProjectorControl.cpp
+#. Hades: the projector control: label of videoscreen.hadesprojectormodesdrp3; translated in Estuary (#54746)
+msgctxt "#62746"
+msgid "Picture mode for SDR in DCI-P3"
+msgstr ""
+
+#: xbmc/network/ProjectorControl.cpp
+#. Hades: the projector control: help of videoscreen.hadesprojectormodesdrp3; translated in Estuary (#54747)
+msgctxt "#62747"
+msgid "The picture mode for HDR that Hades maps to SDR in DCI-P3 (\"HDR to SDR: gamut of the output\" at DCI-P3 (D65)). For example a user mode with a DCI colour profile. As for SDR video: the mode for SDR video (the default). Leave it as it is: Hades does not touch it. A model refuses a mode it does not have, and kodi.log says so."
+msgstr ""
+
